[[File:SW_Executor_01.jpg|thumb|right|300px|The ''[[Executor]]'' was a Star Dreadnought.]]
A '''Star Dreadnought''' was a type of [[dreadnought]].<ref name="UltimateSW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> Some vessels classified as Star Dreadnoughts included the [[Subjugator-class heavy cruiser|''Subjugator''-class heavy cruiser]] used by the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]],<ref name="Collapse">''[[Collapse of the Republic]]''</ref> as well as some [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Super Star Destroyer]]s such as the [[Executor-class Star Dreadnought|''Executor''-class Star Dreadnought]],<ref name="Episode V">{{Film|V}}</ref> and the [[Assertor-class Star Dreadnought|''Assertor''-class Star Dreadnought]],<ref name="Starships and Speeders">''[[Starships and Speeders]]''</ref> as well as [[First Order]] [[capital ship]]s such as the [[Mega-class Star Dreadnought|''Mega''-class Star Dreadnought]] and the specialized [[Mandator IV-class Siege Dreadnought|''Mandator IV''-class Siege Dreadnought]].<ref name="Episode VIII">{{Film|VIII}}</ref>

==Designs==
===''Assertor''-class Star Dreadnought===
[[File:Assertor_LBE.jpg|thumb|220x220px|An ''Assertor''-class Star Dreadnought]]
{{Main|Assertor-class Star Dreadnought}}
The [[Assertor-class Star Dreadnought|''Assertor''-class Star Dreadnought]] was a class of Star Dreadnought utilized by the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Imperial Navy|naval forces]].<ref name="Starships and Speeders" /> Its primary role was acting as a sector command and control ship.<ref name="Lead by Example">''[[Lead by Example]]''</ref>

===''Executor''-class Star Dreadnought===
{{Main|Executor-class Star Dreadnought}}
The [[Executor-class Star Dreadnought|''Executor''-class Star Dreadnought]] was another class of Star Dreadnought<ref name="UltimateSW" /> utilized by the [[Galactic Empire]] during its [[Imperial Era|reign]].<ref name="Episode V" /> It consisted of two variants, the [[Executor I-class Star Dreadnought|''Executor I''-class]], and the [[Executor II-class Star Dreadnought|''Executor II''-class]] Star Dreadnoughts.<ref name="SSDEP">{{Armada|set=Super Star Destroyer Expansion Pack}}</ref>

===''Mandator IV''-class Siege Dreadnought===
[[File:FirstOrderDreadnought-SWFB.png|thumb|220x220px|A ''Mandator IV''-class Siege Dreadnought]]
{{Main|Mandator IV-class Siege Dreadnought}}
The [[Mandator IV-class Siege Dreadnought|''Mandator IV''-class Siege Dreadnought]] was a specialized class of Star Dreadnought, known as a [[Siege Dreadnought]],<ref name="TLJ:ICS">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: Incredible Cross-Sections]]''</ref> that was used by the [[First Order]]. It was designed to lay siege on a planet or a [[fleet]]. An example was the ''[[Fulminatrix]]'', which saw service during the [[Battle of D'Qar]].<ref name="Episode VIII" />

===''Mega''-class Star Dreadnought===
[[File:Supremacy.png|thumb|right|220px|The ''Supremacy'' was the largest ship known to galactic history]]
{{Main|Mega-class Star Dreadnought}}
The [[Mega-class Star Dreadnought|''Mega''-class Star Dreadnought]] was another class of Star Dreadnought utilized by the First Order.<ref name="TLJ:ICS" /> The lone vessel of the class was the ''[[Supremacy]]'',<ref name="TLJ:TVD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> which served as [[Supreme Leader]] [[Snoke]]'s [[flagship]] and the First Order's mobile headquarters.<ref name="Episode VIII" />

===''Subjugator''-class heavy cruiser===
[[File:Malevolence_profile.png|thumb|right|220px|The ''Subjugator''-class heavy cruiser was designated as a class of Star Dreadnought.]]
{{Main|Subjugator-class heavy cruiser}}
The [[Subjugator-class heavy cruiser|''Subjugator''-class heavy cruiser]] manufactured by [[Free Dac Volunteers Engineering Corps]] was a class of [[heavy cruiser]] used by the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], but was also designated as a class of Star Dreadnought. The ''[[Malevolence]]'', the initial testbed of the ''Subjugator''-class, was also designated a Star Dreadnought.<ref name="Collapse" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Star Dreadnought initially appeared in the [[1980]] film [[Star Wars: Episode V The Empire Strikes Back|''Star Wars'': Episode V ''The Empire Strikes Back'']] with the first appearance of the ''[[Executor]]'', an ''Executor''-class Star Dreadnought, the personal flagship of Darth Vader and his personal armada, [[Death Squadron]],<ref name="Episode V" /> however, the class remained unidentified until [[2002]], with the [[Star Wars Legends|Legends]] book ''[[Star Wars: Attack of the Clones Incredible Cross-Sections]]'' released years after ''The Empire Strikes Back''.<ref name="AotCICS">''[[Star Wars: Attack of the Clones Incredible Cross-Sections]]''</ref> Following the [[2014]] [[canon]] reboot, it was used in the reference book ''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]'' in [[2015]].<ref name="UltimateSW" /> And in the [[1983]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi'']], the ''Executor''-class Star Dreadnought was first labeled as a Super Star Destroyer by [[Admiral]] [[Gial Ackbar]] during the [[Battle of Endor]].<ref name="Episode VI">{{Film|VI}}</ref>

